  <History Date="07-04-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="13-05-09" Author="Jonathan Moreton" Comment="Checked" />
  <History Date="09-06-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Updated Colour channel" />
  <History Date="04-11-09" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Fixed locate values, added colour attributes in line with documentation." />
  <History Date="02-02-11" Author="John Rogers" Comment="Edited Reset in response to Clay Paky tech update." />
  <History Date="19-04-12" Author="Locate Fix" Comment="Updated locate, power on, highlight and lowlight values to valid values" />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="08-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed Atlabase ID's to CMY version.  Standardised conditionals.  Added function index." />
  <History Date="08-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Simplified prism in attempt to fix customer bug report.  Increased wheel resolution.  Added pan/tilt limits." />
  <History Date="08-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed colour split to index, revised ranges for full field control and shortened function names.  Added split colour options." />
  <History Date="08-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised function and reset functions.  Revised macros.  Revised timing controls.  Recreated palettes." />
  <History Date="31-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed reset safe range to text only (was value)" />
  <History Date="31-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised mode names to reflect settings more clearly." />
  <History Date="08-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM ID's.  Added product thumbnail." />
  <History Date="06-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches" />
